# Direction

The single channel. The loop agent reads this page at the start of every
iteration. Anything said anywhere else (chat, intercom, commit messages,
Discord) is not an order until it is written here by Joel or a director
running with `CINEMA_ROLE=director`.

Entries are dated, newest first, and stay short. An entry is one of:
`standing` (applies until replaced), `lane` (what to work on now), or
`note` (context, no action).

## Entries

- **2026-09-15 standing.** The first experiment is closed and archived. No
  active study until Joel names the successor in `apps/`. Until then, the
  loop agent's only allowed work is keeping the workspace green and proposing
  the successor's first study chain in a critique file; it must not cut.
- **2026-09-15 standing.** The floor, the three gates, the Material rule,
  and razzle dazzle as the bar remain in force from
  `.brain/resources/art-direction.svx`.
- **2026-09-15 standing.** Colour-lane cuts are paused per Joel (13:05Z);
  colour-01 stays live as shipped.
